    {
      "id": "claim_531c196e21cb4009b365a6b9ddf0fd05",
      "statement": "Spring Data R2DBC repositories are interfaces that you can define to access data. Queries are created automatically from your method names. For example, a CityRepository interface might declare a findAllByState(String state) method to find all the cities in a given state.",
      "evidence": [
